Fonts
-----
The dashboard renders with the Noto Serif and Noto Sans font files shipped
with KOReader. Noto fonts are distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
No font files are bundled in this repository (a `cfont` fallback is used when
the fonts are unavailable).

Data services
-------------
- Hacker News content is provided by the hnmd service (default endpoint
  https://hnmd.miguehm.com/v1). An API key may be required by that service.
- Weather and geocoding data are provided by Open-Meteo
  (https://open-meteo.com/). No API key is required for the endpoints used.
- Discussion links point to https://news.ycombinator.com/.

No code from these services is vendored here; the plugin only makes HTTP
requests to their public APIs.

